{"id":"gr961kl8zwepoll4bgw9mg2sb","title":"微软索尼等大厂收购的游戏工作室近三分之一已关闭","originalTitle":"1/3被收购工作室关闭，微软、索尼马失前蹄","summary":"自2020年以来，被大型企业取得过半数股份的游戏工作室中，已有123家被直接关闭，平均关闭时间为5年。尽管微软、索尼等曾大手笔收购游戏工作室，但市场环境变化导致这些工作室难以维持。未来，大厂将更多依赖AI技术来提升研发效率和游戏产能，玩家可能需要在众多新游戏中“沙里淘金”。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15317820.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T02:34:46.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T02:47:45.527Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T02:47:45.527Z","category":"stock-us","tags":["破产清算","Microsoft"],"score":42,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(三易生活)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"microsoft","name":"Microsoft / 微软"},{"slug":"bankruptcy","name":"破产与清算"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}